abstract: "Deterministic 2D and 3D world laboratories with partially observed agents, an EFMW-inspired coherence kernel, volumetric diffusion, bounded recursive search, and checkpoint branching. Developed with OpenAI Codex assistance. Physical and AGI interpretations remain unvalidated."
